        "summary": "Endlessly is the story of an endless love that happened on a beach. A love so seamless and so lustful, it appeared to have no beginning and no end. But what an end Nikki had! And what a bod Crystal Wilder had. We're sorry. We digress. Enjoy Endlessly. After all, it won't be around forever.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7esq.jpg",
