      {
        "id": 245313,
        "name": "Gateway to English: Eigo de Go!",
        "summary": "This game is designed to teach Japanese how to speak English through four different activities. Those activities include:\n\nTyping on an English or Japanese Katakana tutor keyboard to learn words and the objects that pair with them.\nFour different domestic locations with objects and their names dictated.\nFour categories of puzzles that indicate objects and their relationships.\nFour radios with their own topic, which show an object, the name in English and the name in Japanese.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dod.jpg",
